window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Following an unsuspected night of passion with a series of men, Seven is left reeling and quickly discovers that everyone’s actions have lasting consequences.</p> <p>She finds herself attempting to navigate what a life intertwined with three men looks like and with Kenji’s strained familial relationships, Gael’s daunting past and Tryp’s long-term girlfriend, their effortless night of fun is quickly forgotten as they all grapple with if their one-night stand can truly lead to a happily ever after.</p> <p>*This is a why choose romance with multiple men and women in ONE relationship dynamic*</p>"; 
